      "name": "COMMAND HUEY INSERTION CHECK",
      "taskForce": "COMMAND TEST TEAM",
      "version": "1.1.0-rc.3 / bridge 0.15.0",
      "briefing": "Import this one-file mission, inspect the departure on the map, review deployment and approve it in Reforger. Confirm the AI pilot and four passengers are seated. Open helicopter flight controls, refresh targets, select TEAM and the aircraft, choose speed and waypoints, and mark a clear, flat LZ. Review and approve flight separately. Importing runs no orders. There is no artificial flight-distance limit. Optional waypoint heights are minimum metres above ground; automatic clearance may fly higher. Preflight checks do not guarantee tree clearance or dynamic obstacle avoidance. Keep observers outside during assistance. Inspect the full route and LZ in the current session; long routes, human takeover and multiplayer need operator acceptance."
